        }
      ],
      "updated": 1786113217676,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "UI Protection is Not Enough: Frontend hiding and middleware can sometimes be \nbypassed; true security must be enforced at the backend.\n\nSecure the Data Layer: Backend functions must explicitly throw an error if the user is not authenticated, \nensuring data safety against any external vulnerabilities.\n\n1- connect Convex with clerk in a nextjs app check the docs ",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "UI Protection is Not Enough: Frontend hiding and middleware can sometimes be \nbypassed; true security must be enforced at the backend.\n\nSecure the Data Layer: Backend functions must explicitly throw an error if the user is not authenticated, \nensuring data safety against any external vulnerabilities.\n\n1- connect Convex with clerk in a nextjs app check the docs ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
